a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软2027财年首季从OpenAI相关合作获利100亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google发布Gemini 4 Carbon模型，以59分登顶Intelligence Index v5.0</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic内部Claude模型自主挖掘漏洞并实现Linux提权</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达拟投资30亿美元入股Meta并深化AI基础设施合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达计划投资30亿美元参与Meta的股权融资，双方将进一步扩大在人工智能领域的合作。Meta此次计划通过股票发行筹集最高950亿美元，专项用于AI基础设施建设。作为合作深化的一部分，Meta将在其下一代AI代理程序中大规模采用英伟达基础设施，包括Vera Rubin系统与Vera CPU，并围绕Meta的AI模型Muse展开深度技术协作。此外，AMD与博通也表达了合计购买至多50亿美元Meta股票的意向。此举延续了芯片厂商向核心客户注资、客户再采购其算力设备建设数据中心的“循环融资”模式。随着AI基础设施投入激增，芯片厂商与大型科技公司在资本与技术层面的绑定日益紧密，市场正密切关注此类合作的实际算力需求匹配度及可持续性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯宣布混元Hy4及Hy4flash即将发布，模型能力与思维链效率全面升级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be4b1431b360d9ee498f60b9a23ac46f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯在2026全球数字生态大会上宣布，新一代大模型Hy4及轻量化版本Hy4flash即将发布。Hy4在Hy4preview基础上实现全面提升，重点强化了长程任务处理与真实生产力场景表现，显著优化思维链效率，并首次引入视觉理解能力。Hy4flash则定位为高性价比实用模型，在继承Hy4视觉及Agent能力的基础上，通过模型与产品的深度Co-Design实现高频进化。此前，腾讯于8月28日开源了Hy4preview，该模型拥有770B总参数、49B激活参数及1M上下文长度。此次Hy4系列的迭代，标志着腾讯在保持开源模型第一梯队竞争力的同时，进一步向生产力工具与极致性价比应用场景深化布局，将为开发者与企业用户提供更高效的AI基础设施支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软2027财年首季从OpenAI相关合作获利100亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软2027财年首季（截至2026年9月30日）财报显示，其通过与OpenAI的合作实现100亿美元收入，占当季总营收的近11%。若按此趋势，该业务全年规模有望达400亿美元。双方于今年4月重修协议，OpenAI承诺在2030年前持续向微软分润，并额外采购2500亿美元Azure算力资源。尽管微软持有的OpenAI股份从6月的25%稀释至9月的24%，但双方的商业纽带进一步加固。目前OpenAI对微软仍有72亿美元应收账款。分析认为，双方已演变为“既是伙伴又是对手”的复杂联盟，在企业客户、生成式AI平台及开发工具领域展开竞争的同时，通过Azure算力依赖与长期分成机制深度绑定，微软持续从OpenAI的增长中获取红利。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google发布Gemini 4 Carbon模型，以59分登顶Intelligence Index v5.0</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5fb85d629d94f4850f68d36199c3aa1d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式推出新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4 Carbon，在Artificial Analysis的Intelligence Index v5.0基准测试中以59分位列第一，超越Claude Opus 5.5与GPT-6 Astra。该模型在Arena.ai的Text Arena登顶，Agent Arena排名第二。Gemini 4 Carbon核心聚焦长时程工程与网络安全能力，在SEC-bench Pro与CWE-bench中分别取得88.2%和71.0%的成绩，安全代码生成成功率较前代Argon提升两倍，且实现间接提示词注入防御100%。在可靠性方面，Terminal-Bench 4.0测试显示其模型“作弊”成功率为0。目前该模型仅向少量网络安全防御人员开放，定价沿用Argon标准</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic内部Claude模型自主挖掘漏洞并实现Linux提权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0bc19e8d5c77782b01d62f0e2d95bcf9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于10月27日发布报告，展示其内部研究模型在无需人工干预下，自主定位并利用Chrome、Safari、Android、Windows及Linux系统漏洞。最显著的案例是模型在Linux内核网络栈中发现零点击远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-98432），仅耗时53分钟便通过多路径TCP监听器获取root shell。此外，该模型向谷歌提交了62个Chrome高危CVE，涵盖沙箱逃逸与渲染进程漏洞，补丁已随Chrome 156落地。在Android端，模型利用USB缺陷绕过Pixel 9锁屏获取本地数据；在Safari端则通过绕过同源策略窃取敏感信息。针对Windows，模型发现HTTP/3内核越界读取漏洞（CVE-2026-33096）。目前所有漏洞均已通报厂商并完成修复。此次测试凸显了LL</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
